# Module 2 REFERENCE backend source. The live app calls a teammate's
# separately-hosted HuggingFace Space (see ml-backends/module2/README.md) —
# this folder is unused source code, not a deployment, and its ML deps
# (torch, transformers, gliner, sentence-transformers, ...) bundle to several
# GB, far past Vercel's function size limit.
#
# It used to live in `api/`, which is why deployments broke: Vercel turns
# every file under `api/` into a Serverless Function, so `requirements.txt`
# made it try to build `app.py` with the Python runtime. It now lives outside
# `api/` so that can never happen again — this entry is belt-and-braces so the
# multi-hundred-MB artifacts are not even uploaded.
ml-backends/

# Training data / notebook exports — not needed by the build or the API.
dataset.csv
